{"seq":3,"slug":"tokenization","title":"音乐 Token 化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/tokenization","wordCount":1451,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"音乐-token-化策略\">音乐 Token 化策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Token 化是把音乐塞进序列模型的前提，理解它需要抓住四个要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多维压缩到一维</strong>：时间、音高、力度、音色必须同时编码进单条 Token 序列，词表大小与序列长度是核心张力。</li>\n<li><strong>REMI 显式建模位置</strong>：用 Bar/Position Token 让模型直接感知节拍结构，无需从 delta-time 反推对齐。</li>\n<li><strong>Compound Word 提高密度</strong>：把同一事件的多个属性合并为单个 Token，换来更短序列与并行预测。</li>\n<li><strong>音频 Token 化打通模态</strong>：RVQ 把波形压成离散码，使语言模型式方法可以作用于音频。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四个要点共同回答了&quot;为什么要 Token 化、怎么编码符号事件、如何压缩序列、音频如何进入同一范式&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"token-化的核心挑战\">Token 化的核心挑战</h2><p>音乐 Token 化（Music Tokenization）是将连续或半连续的音乐数据转化为离散 Token 序列的过程——这是应用 Transformer 等序列模型的前提。挑战在于音乐的多维性：时间、音高、力度、音色需要同时编码到一维序列中：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Music</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>Tokenize</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Token Sequence</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">V</mi><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Music} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Tokenize}} \\text{Token Sequence} = [t_1, t_2, \\ldots, t_N] \\in \\mathcal{V}^N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Music</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Tokenize</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Token Sequence</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是词表（Vocabulary），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是序列长度。词表大小和序列长度的权衡是设计的核心张力——词表越大每步信息越多但学习更难，序列越长覆盖越完整但计算成本更高。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Token 化方法</th>\n<th>词表大小</th>\n<th>序列长度（1min）</th>\n<th>适用模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MIDI事件逐个Token</td>\n<td>~400</td>\n<td>~5,000</td>\n<td>GPT-style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REMI (多属性合并)</td>\n<td>~300</td>\n<td>~2,000</td>\n<td>Music Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compound Word</td>\n<td>~500</td>\n<td>~1,000</td>\n<td>CP Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Audio Codec Tokens</td>\n<td>1024×8层</td>\n<td>~4,500/层</td>\n<td>MusicGen/SoundStorm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BPE on MIDI</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>~1,500</td>\n<td>TokenMixer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 输入[&quot;音乐数据&quot;]&#10;        MI[&quot;MIDI Events&lt;br/&gt;Note On/Off/CC&quot;]&#10;        AU[&quot;Audio Waveform&lt;br/&gt;连续信号&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 策略[&quot;Token化策略&quot;]&#10;        EV[&quot;事件级Token&lt;br/&gt;每个MIDI事件一个Token&quot;]&#10;        RE[&quot;REMI&lt;br/&gt;位置+音高+力度+时值&quot;]&#10;        CW[&quot;Compound Word&lt;br/&gt;多属性压缩&quot;]&#10;        AC[&quot;Audio Codec&lt;br/&gt;RVQ离散码&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 输出[&quot;Token序列&quot;]&#10;        S1[&quot;长序列&lt;br/&gt;信息逐步展开&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;中等序列&lt;br/&gt;平衡信息密度&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;短序列&lt;br/&gt;高压缩&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    MI --&gt; EV --&gt; S1&#10;    MI --&gt; RE --&gt; S2&#10;    MI --&gt; CW --&gt; S3&#10;    AU --&gt; AC --&gt; S2\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 输入[\"音乐数据\"]\n        MI[\"MIDI Events&lt;br/&gt;Note On/Off/CC\"]\n        AU[\"Audio Waveform&lt;br/&gt;连续信号\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 策略[\"Token化策略\"]\n        EV[\"事件级Token&lt;br/&gt;每个MIDI事件一个Token\"]\n        RE[\"REMI&lt;br/&gt;位置+音高+力度+时值\"]\n        CW[\"Compound Word&lt;br/&gt;多属性压缩\"]\n        AC[\"Audio Codec&lt;br/&gt;RVQ离散码\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 输出[\"Token序列\"]\n        S1[\"长序列&lt;br/&gt;信息逐步展开\"]\n        S2[\"中等序列&lt;br/&gt;平衡信息密度\"]\n        S3[\"短序列&lt;br/&gt;高压缩\"]\n    end\n    MI --&gt; EV --&gt; S1\n    MI --&gt; RE --&gt; S2\n    MI --&gt; CW --&gt; S3\n    AU --&gt; AC --&gt; S2</pre><h2 id=\"remi-表示法\">REMI 表示法</h2><p>REMI（REvamped MIDI-derived representation）是 Pop Music Transformer 提出的里程碑式 Token 化方案。它引入位置 Token 和 Bar/Position 概念，使模型能感知音乐的节拍结构：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>REMI Sequence</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Bar</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Position</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Pitch</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Duration</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Velocity</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{REMI Sequence} = [\\text{Bar}, \\text{Position}, \\text{Pitch}, \\text{Duration}, \\text{Velocity}, \\ldots]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">REMI Sequence</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bar</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Position</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pitch</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Duration</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Velocity</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Token 类型</th>\n<th>词表范围</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bar</td>\n<td>1种</td>\n<td>小节开始标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Position</td>\n<td>1/16–16/16</td>\n<td>小节内位置（16分音符网格）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pitch</td>\n<td>0–127</td>\n<td>MIDI 音高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Duration</td>\n<td>1–64（16分音符单位）</td>\n<td>音符时值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Velocity</td>\n<td>bin_1–bin_32</td>\n<td>力度（分箱）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tempo</td>\n<td>30–210</td>\n<td>BPM变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chord</td>\n<td>根音×质量</td>\n<td>和弦标记</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph MIDI原始[&quot;MIDI原始事件&quot;]&#10;        N1[&quot;NoteOn C4 vel80 tick480&quot;]&#10;        N2[&quot;NoteOff C4 tick720&quot;]&#10;        N3[&quot;NoteOn E4 vel64 tick720&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph REMI转换[&quot;REMI Token化&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;Bar&quot;]&#10;        P1[&quot;Position 1/4&quot;]&#10;        PI1[&quot;Pitch 60&quot;]&#10;        D1[&quot;Duration 2&quot;]&#10;        V1[&quot;Velocity bin_5&quot;]&#10;        P2[&quot;Position 2/4&quot;]&#10;        PI2[&quot;Pitch 64&quot;]&#10;        D2[&quot;Duration 4&quot;]&#10;        V2[&quot;Velocity bin_4&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    N1 --&gt; B&#10;    N1 --&gt; P1&#10;    N1 --&gt; PI1&#10;    N1 --&gt; D1&#10;    N1 --&gt; V1&#10;    N3 --&gt; P2&#10;    N3 --&gt; PI2&#10;    N3 --&gt; D2&#10;    N3 --&gt; V2\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph MIDI原始[\"MIDI原始事件\"]\n        N1[\"NoteOn C4 vel80 tick480\"]\n        N2[\"NoteOff C4 tick720\"]\n        N3[\"NoteOn E4 vel64 tick720\"]\n    end\n    subgraph REMI转换[\"REMI Token化\"]\n        B[\"Bar\"]\n        P1[\"Position 1/4\"]\n        PI1[\"Pitch 60\"]\n        D1[\"Duration 2\"]\n        V1[\"Velocity bin_5\"]\n        P2[\"Position 2/4\"]\n        PI2[\"Pitch 64\"]\n        D2[\"Duration 4\"]\n        V2[\"Velocity bin_4\"]\n    end\n    N1 --&gt; B\n    N1 --&gt; P1\n    N1 --&gt; PI1\n    N1 --&gt; D1\n    N1 --&gt; V1\n    N3 --&gt; P2\n    N3 --&gt; PI2\n    N3 --&gt; D2\n    N3 --&gt; V2</pre><p>REMI 的核心洞察是：通过显式编码位置信息，模型不需要从 delta-time 中&quot;计算&quot;节拍对齐，降低了学习难度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"compound-word-token-化\">Compound Word Token 化</h2><p>Compound Word（复合词）策略将描述同一个音乐事件的多个属性合并为单个 Token 向量，而非展开为多个独立 Token。这大幅缩短序列长度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Compound Token</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>type</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>pitch</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>duration</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>velocity</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>position</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Compound Token}_i = [\\text{type}_i, \\text{pitch}_i, \\text{duration}_i, \\text{velocity}_i, \\text{position}_i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Compound Token</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">type</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pitch</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duration</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">velocity</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">position</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个 Compound Token 是多维向量，各维度有独立嵌入，然后聚合为统一表示输入 Transformer：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>Aggregate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>type</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>type</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>pitch</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>pitch</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_i = \\text{Aggregate}(E_{\\text{type}}[\\text{type}_i], E_{\\text{pitch}}[\\text{pitch}_i], \\ldots)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Aggregate</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">type</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">type</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pitch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pitch</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>REMI（展开式）</th>\n<th>Compound Word</th>\n<th>优势方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>序列长度</td>\n<td>~5 tokens/note</td>\n<td>1 token/note</td>\n<td>CW（5x短）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>词表复杂度</td>\n<td>单维简单词表</td>\n<td>多维组合空间</td>\n<td>REMI（更简单）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性独立性</td>\n<td>每属性独立预测</td>\n<td>并行预测</td>\n<td>CW（更高效）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺失属性</td>\n<td>自然处理</td>\n<td>需要 PAD/NA</td>\n<td>REMI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自注意力</td>\n<td>跨属性注意力</td>\n<td>仅跨事件注意力</td>\n<td>取决于任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph REMI方式[&quot;REMI: 展开为多Token&quot;]&#10;        R1[&quot;Position_1&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;Pitch_60&quot;]&#10;        R3[&quot;Duration_4&quot;]&#10;        R4[&quot;Velocity_5&quot;]&#10;        R5[&quot;Position_2&quot;]&#10;        R6[&quot;Pitch_64&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CW方式[&quot;Compound Word: 每事件一Token&quot;]&#10;        C1[&quot;Event_1&lt;br/&gt;pos:1 pitch:60 dur:4 vel:5&quot;]&#10;        C2[&quot;Event_2&lt;br/&gt;pos:2 pitch:64 dur:2 vel:4&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 比较[&quot;序列长度比较&quot;]&#10;        LR[&quot;REMI: 6 tokens&lt;br/&gt;for 2 notes&quot;]&#10;        LC[&quot;CW: 2 tokens&lt;br/&gt;for 2 notes&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    R1 --&gt; LR&#10;    C1 --&gt; LC\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph REMI方式[\"REMI: 展开为多Token\"]\n        R1[\"Position_1\"]\n        R2[\"Pitch_60\"]\n        R3[\"Duration_4\"]\n        R4[\"Velocity_5\"]\n        R5[\"Position_2\"]\n        R6[\"Pitch_64\"]\n    end\n    subgraph CW方式[\"Compound Word: 每事件一Token\"]\n        C1[\"Event_1&lt;br/&gt;pos:1 pitch:60 dur:4 vel:5\"]\n        C2[\"Event_2&lt;br/&gt;pos:2 pitch:64 dur:2 vel:4\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 比较[\"序列长度比较\"]\n        LR[\"REMI: 6 tokens&lt;br/&gt;for 2 notes\"]\n        LC[\"CW: 2 tokens&lt;br/&gt;for 2 notes\"]\n    end\n    R1 --&gt; LR\n    C1 --&gt; LC</pre><h2 id=\"音频-token-化与-rvq\">音频 Token 化与 RVQ</h2><p>音频 Token 化是近两年的突破性进展——通过神经音频编码器（如 EnCodec）将连续波形转换为离散 Token，使语言模型方法直接应用于音频生成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Audio</mtext><mrow><mn>24</mn><mtext>kHz</mtext></mrow></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>Encoder</mtext></mpadded></mover><mi>z</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msup><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>RVQ</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Codes</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1023</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>×</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Audio}_{24\\text{kHz}} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Encoder}} z \\in \\mathbb{R}^{T&#x27; \\times D} \\xrightarrow{\\text{RVQ}} \\text{Codes} \\in \\{0,...,1023\\}^{T&#x27; \\times Q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2581em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Audio</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">24</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">kHz</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Encoder</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"t