lass=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8278em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">RVQ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Codes</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2425em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1023</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9925em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8278em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>320</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T&#x27; = T/320</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">/320</span></span></span></span></span>（下采样因子 320），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是 RVQ 层数（通常 8–32），每层有 1024 个码本条目。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RVQ 层</th>\n<th>编码内容</th>\n<th>比特率贡献</th>\n<th>感知重要性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第 1 层</td>\n<td>粗略频谱轮廓</td>\n<td>750 bps</td>\n<td>最高（语义）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 2 层</td>\n<td>频谱细节</td>\n<td>750 bps</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 3–4 层</td>\n<td>瞬态/texture</td>\n<td>1500 bps</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 5–8 层</td>\n<td>高频细节/噪声</td>\n<td>3000 bps</td>\n<td>低（质量精修）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 量化[&quot;RVQ逐层量化&quot;]&#10;        Z[&quot;连续向量 z&quot;]&#10;        Q1[&quot;第1层量化&lt;br/&gt;粗略逼近&quot;]&#10;        R1[&quot;残差 r1 = z - q1&quot;]&#10;        Q2[&quot;第2层量化&lt;br/&gt;残差逼近&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;残差 r2 = r1 - q2&quot;]&#10;        QN[&quot;第N层量化&lt;br/&gt;精细残差&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 重建[&quot;重建&quot;]&#10;        SUM[&quot;求和: q1+q2+...+qN&quot;]&#10;        ZH[&quot;近似 z_hat&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Z --&gt; Q1&#10;    Q1 --&gt; R1&#10;    R1 --&gt; Q2&#10;    Q2 --&gt; R2&#10;    R2 --&gt; QN&#10;    Q1 --&gt; SUM&#10;    Q2 --&gt; SUM&#10;    QN --&gt; SUM&#10;    SUM --&gt; ZH\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 量化[\"RVQ逐层量化\"]\n        Z[\"连续向量 z\"]\n        Q1[\"第1层量化&lt;br/&gt;粗略逼近\"]\n        R1[\"残差 r1 = z - q1\"]\n        Q2[\"第2层量化&lt;br/&gt;残差逼近\"]\n        R2[\"残差 r2 = r1 - q2\"]\n        QN[\"第N层量化&lt;br/&gt;精细残差\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 重建[\"重建\"]\n        SUM[\"求和: q1+q2+...+qN\"]\n        ZH[\"近似 z_hat\"]\n    end\n    Z --&gt; Q1\n    Q1 --&gt; R1\n    R1 --&gt; Q2\n    Q2 --&gt; R2\n    R2 --&gt; QN\n    Q1 --&gt; SUM\n    Q2 --&gt; SUM\n    QN --&gt; SUM\n    SUM --&gt; ZH</pre><p>RVQ 的层级结构自然对应&quot;粗到细&quot;的生成策略：先生成第一层（语义/结构），再逐层生成后续层（细节/质量），这也是 MusicGen 和 SoundStorm 的核心设计思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"token-化设计的权衡空间\">Token 化设计的权衡空间</h2><p>不同任务和模型对 Token 化有不同偏好。设计 Token 化方案需要在多个维度做出权衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Tradeoff</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>Compression</mtext><mo>↔</mo><mtext>Fidelity</mtext><mo>↔</mo><mtext>Learnability</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Tradeoff}: \\text{Compression} \\leftrightarrow \\text{Fidelity} \\leftrightarrow \\text{Learnability}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Tradeoff</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Compression</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fidelity</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Learnability</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计维度</th>\n<th>选项 A</th>\n<th>选项 B</th>\n<th>权衡因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>粒度</td>\n<td>细粒度（每属性）</td>\n<td>粗粒度（每事件）</td>\n<td>序列长度 vs 灵活性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>绝对时间</td>\n<td>相对时间</td>\n<td>位移不变 vs 位置感知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音高</td>\n<td>绝对音高</td>\n<td>相对音程</td>\n<td>调性不变 vs 绝对生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多轨</td>\n<td>交错（一序列）</td>\n<td>独立（多序列）</td>\n<td>上下文共享 vs 并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音频</td>\n<td>固定码率</td>\n<td>可变码率</td>\n<td>计算统一 vs 效率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Token 化不是一次性决策——它与模型架构和训练目标共同演化。最佳实践是：先确定任务目标，再选择信息保留优先级，最后设计具体编码方案。Token 化质量直接决定模型的生成上限——再强大的模型也无法生成 Token 化过程中已经丢失的信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Token 化把多维音乐压成一维离散序列，词表大小与序列长度互相牵制。</li>\n<li>REMI 引入 Bar/Position Token，显式建模节拍对齐，降低模型学习难度。</li>\n<li>Compound Word 把事件多属性合并为单 Token，序列更短但需处理缺失属性。</li>\n<li>音频 Token 化借助 RVQ 把波形变成离散码，让语言模型方法直接作用于音频。</li>\n<li>粒度、时间、音高、多轨、码率五个维度的取舍共同决定生成上限。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"音乐 Token 化策略","id":"音乐-token-化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Token 化的核心挑战","id":"token-化的核心挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"REMI 表示法","id":"remi-表示法"},{"level":2,"text":"Compound Word Token 化","id":"compound-word-token-化"},{"level":2,"text":"音频 Token 化与 RVQ","id":"音频-token-化与-rvq"},{"level":2,"text":"Token 化设计的权衡空间","id":"token-化设计的权衡空间"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"音频频谱表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/music-representation/audio-spectrogram"},"next":{"title":"Transformer 音乐生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/ai-music-generation/generative-models/transformer-music"}}